edentials:",[221,222,228],"pre",{"className":223,"code":225,"language":226,"meta":227},[224],"language-text","Username: demo\nPassword: fivenet-demo\n","text","",[229,230,225],"code",{"__ignoreMap":227},[200,232,234],{"icon":233},"i-mdi-info-slab-circle",[186,235,236],{},"Not every feature is fully available in the demo environment. Some advanced functionality may be limited or simulated.",[213,238,240],{"id":239},"best-way-to-explore","Best Way to Explore",[186,242,243,244,247,248,251],{},"The demo account includes multiple characters. For the best overview, use the ",[208,245,246],{},"Los Santos Police Department (LSPD)"," character with the ",[229,249,250],{},"police"," job.",[186,253,254,255,258],{},"This character has access to ",[208,256,257],{},"superuser mode",", which lets you:",[260,261,262,266],"ul",{},[263,264,265],"li",{},"Switch between jobs",[263,267,268],{},"Explore administrative features",[186,270,271,272,275],{},"You can enable or disable superuser mode from the ",[208,273,274],{},"user menu"," in the left sidebar.",[200,277,280],{"icon":278,"color":279},"i-mdi-lightbulb-on-outline","info",[186,281,282],{},"If you want to explore as much of FiveNet as possible, start with the police character and enable superuser mode.",[213,284,286],{"id":285},"feedback","Feedback",[186,288,289],{},"If you run into problems or have suggestions, reach out to the FiveNet team on Discord.",{"title":227,"searchDepth":291,"depth":291,"links":292},2,[293,294,295],{"id":215,"depth":291,"text":216},{"id":239,"depth":291,"text":240},{"id":285,"depth":291,"text":286},"Try FiveNet using the public demo instance.","md",null,{},true,"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fdemo",{"title":15,"description":296},"1.getting-started\u002F2.demo","zmgFGSF0IMz-keHr9k8AtB3j52j6y5BtxHX8AKsWRoc",[306,311],{"title":307,"path":308,"stem":309,"description":310,"children":-1},"Features","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ffeatures","1.getting-started\u002F1.features","Overview of the features provided by FiveN